	'rooms_s1_p1' => 'The Halden Teachers\' Association held its spring forum here: 160 people, one day, with lunch next door in the Atrium. If your list is near 160, Linden is the room. If it is near 420, the conversation starts in Meridian Hall. Both open onto the same corridor.',
