	'ia_hero_hall_webp' => 'Staff laying notepads along the rows of an empty conference hall before delegates arrive.',
	'meridian-hall_lead' => 'Meridian Hall is the plenary room: 420 seats in theatre or 260 at banquet, on the harbour side of the warehouse. Association congresses, AGMs and full-day plenaries are what the room is set for.',
	'meridian-hall_s0_h' => 'Capacity, stage and the day rate',
	'meridian-hall_s0_p0' => 'Meridian Hall is contracted in two layouts. Theatre seats 420. Banquet seats 260. Those are the figures on the plan and on the invoice. The hall is set with a stage for the speaker at the lectern, and with standard AV. Daniel Kowalski leads AV and technical. When the programme needs it, a technician works from the sound desk at the back of the hall. The full-day room rate is €6,800. A half day is 60 percent of that rate.',
	'meridian-hall_s0_p1' => 'On an event day the building is open from 7:00 to 23:00, and your coordinator is on site from 7:00. Before delegates arrive, Owen Mbeki\'s early facilities shift lays notepads and pencils along the empty rows. At 6:45 the hall is already in order. The day delegate package, if you add it, is €68 a person and includes a share of the room, two coffee breaks, lunch and that standard AV.',
	'ia_av_desk_webp' => 'A technician at the sound desk at the back of the hall.',
	'meridian-hall_s1_h' => 'A congress of 420',
