	'plan-an-event_label' => 'PLAN AN EVENT',
	'plan-an-event_pill' => 'Free hold · 48 hours',
	'plan-an-event_h1' => 'Plan an event',
	'plan-an-event_r0_l' => 'Step 1',
	'plan-an-event_r0_v' => 'Enquiry and a free 48-hour hold',
	'plan-an-event_r1_l' => 'Step 2',
	'plan-an-event_r1_v' => 'Weekday site visit',
	'plan-an-event_r2_l' => 'Step 3',
	'plan-an-event_r2_v' => 'Contract, run sheet, 30% deposit',
	'plan-an-event_r3_l' => 'Step 4',
	'plan-an-event_r3_v' => 'Event day, coordinator on site from 7:00',
	'rates_lead' => 'Room rates are in euros for a full day, and a half day is 60 percent of that figure. The six lines below are the same rates published on the home page.',
	'rates_s0_h' => 'Full-day rates',
	'rates_s0_p0' => 'Rates are in euros, the same six lines on this page and on the home page. Meridian Hall is €6,800 for a full day. The Atrium is €2,600. The Linden Room is €1,900. The Quay Room is €640. Each Studio Room is €420. The day delegate package is €68 a person. These are the published rates. A half day is 60 percent of the full-day room rate. A short workshop in a Studio is not billed as a full day when it is genuinely a half day, and a short hire of the Atrium is not automatically €2,600.',
	'rates_s0_p1' => 'The half-day rule is a note under the table, and it applies to the rooms. Ask, when you enquire, whether your delegate numbers follow the full day or a shorter presence. We do not publish a second currency. The room you hire and the people on the package are separate lines, added together on the contract.',
	'rt_th1' => 'Room',
	'rt_th2' => 'Full day',
	'rt_th3' => 'Half day (60%)',
	'rt_note' => 'Rates in euros. A half day is 60% of the full-day room rate; the day delegate package is per person and is added to the room line.',
	'rates_s1_h' => 'What does the day delegate package include?',
	'rates_s1_p0' => 'The day delegate package is €68 a person. It includes four things, and only these: a share of the hired room, two coffee breaks, lunch, and standard AV. Coffee and lunch come from the kitchen led by Lucía Romero. Standard AV is Daniel Kowalski\'s technical brief, including the sound desk when the meeting is in Meridian Hall. The package does not stand in for the room rate. You still hire Meridian Hall at €6,800, the Atrium at €2,600, the Linden Room at €1,900, a Studio at €420, or the Quay Room at €640, and then add €68 for each person on the package.',
	'rates_s1_p1' => 'If you want the room only, say so, and the run sheet will not assume breaks or lunch. Dietary requirements are collected with the registration names and passed to the kitchen with that headcount. The package price is the same for a three-day congress delegate and for a person on a one-day forum.',
	'rates_s2_h' => 'When is the deposit due, and what does the hold cost?',
	'rates_s2_p0' => 'The provisional hold is free and lasts 48 hours. It does not collect money. It keeps the rooms you named while you decide, after an enquiry and before a contract. The deposit is 30 percent and it is due on contract, once the site visit is done and the rooms and the run sheet are agreed. The balance is due 14 days after the event, not on the morning and not before the event. Office hours for this correspondence are Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00.',
	'rates_s2_p1' => 'The event-day clock is different: the building is open from 7:00 to 23:00, and your coordinator is on site from 7:00. Paying the deposit is the third step. The hold is the first. If the hold lapses, no deposit is asked for, because no contract was formed. A second hold on a new date is a new enquiry, again free for 48 hours.',
	'rates_s3_h' => 'When can you cancel, and what is charged?',
	'rates_s3_p0' => 'Cancellation is free until 90 days before the event. From 89 days out until 30 days out, the cancellation charge is 50 percent. Under 30 days, the cancellation charge is 100 percent. The date on the contract is the date the bands are counted from. Changing rooms during a free hold, before any contract, is not a cancellation and has no charge. After the contract is signed, a cancellation follows the three bands.',
	'rates_s3_p1' => 'Write to the office on a weekday and we will confirm which band the notice falls in. The open day on Saturday 14 November 2026 is a public hall tour from 10:00 to 15:00, with no booking and no hire, so this scale does not apply to a tour. It applies to a contracted event in Meridian Hall, the Linden Room, the Atrium, a Studio or the Quay Room.',
