	'about_r3_v' => '1920s harbour customs warehouse',
	'ia_intro_setup_webp' => 'Hands placing pencils and blank name cards on a wooden table.',
	'contact_lead' => 'The office is open Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00, for enquiries and for site visits by appointment. On event days the building itself runs from 7:00 to 23:00.',
	'contact_s0_h' => 'Email, telephone and the office day',
	'contact_s0_p0' => 'Email the office at hello@kaigi-centre.example. Telephone calls are taken in the same hours, Monday to Friday, from 9:00 to 18:00. Give your name, the organisation, the date, the headcount and the room you have in mind. A congress near 420 delegates starts with Meridian Hall. A classroom near 120 or a theatre near 160 starts with the Linden Room. A standing reception near 300 starts with the Atrium. A team day of 24 to 36 starts with a Studio Room.',
	'contact_s0_p1' => 'A board of 16 starts with the Quay Room. The reply is either a free 48-hour hold on the rooms you named, or a question if the headcount and the room do not match. Letters and visits use one address: 12 Quay Street, Halden Harbour. The enquiry form on this page, and the form on Plan an event, both come to the same office. Neither form takes the deposit. Payment belongs to the contract.',
	'contact_s1_h' => 'Open day and site visits',
	'contact_s1_p0' => 'The open day is Saturday 14 November 2026. Hall tours run from 10:00 to 15:00, and you do not need to book. Come to 12 Quay Street. The walk from Halden Central is six minutes, and tram line 2 stops at Quay Street. A site visit is a different kind of call. It is by appointment, on a weekday, inside office hours, and it is the second step after a hold. Use the visit when you are ready to walk specific rooms and talk about layouts, rates and the run sheet.',
	'contact_s1_p1' => 'Use the open day when you want to see the halls without a contract in view. Tours are not hired events. The room rates, the 30 percent deposit and the cancellation bands apply only once a contract exists. If a tour is enough to make you choose a date, write afterwards and we will place the 48-hour hold on the next weekday we are open.',
	'contact_s2_h' => 'Who answers which question',
	'contact_s2_p0' => 'For a first enquiry you only need the office, Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00. Once a contract exists, the names are useful. Your coordinator is on site from 7:00 on the event day. Registration questions go to Priya Raman\'s delegate services, including the foyer desk that opens at 7:30 for a congress. Room setup goes to Amara Nwosu\'s operations crew. AV and the sound desk go to Daniel Kowalski. The kitchen goes to Lucía Romero.',
	'contact_s2_p1' => 'The booking itself stays with Tomás Ferreira, head of events. Ingrid Halvorsen is director, and has been since 2009. Owen Mbeki is the early facilities shift in the hall. Parking for a weekday visit is among the 62 spaces on the quay. On an ordinary weekday the office receives the appointments it has made. The time for an unbooked look at the halls is the open day, Saturday 14 November 2026, between 10:00 and 15:00.',
